preConditionHook:
// EL Date is the bar's wall-clock close date (EL_Date_Probe.txt, 169/169
// bars incl. evening bars), and date[1] is the DATA series' real history --
// MaxBarsBack bars exist before the strategy's first evaluated bar, so
// ctx.Time(1) is always valid here and needs no first-bar guard (unlike an
// EL VARIABLE's zero-filled warm-up, which does not apply to Date).
// EL Year(Date) returns the calendar year MINUS 1900 (EL_Date_Probe.txt);
// only inequality is tested, so the offset cancels and the civil years
// compare directly.
curYear = civil_from_days(day_of(ctx.Time(0))).year;
curMonth = civil_from_days(day_of(ctx.Time(0))).month;
prevYear = civil_from_days(day_of(ctx.Time(1))).year;
prevMonth = civil_from_days(day_of(ctx.Time(1))).month;
